# compiled output
bin/
pkg/
target/

# local emulator / runtime state -- each adapter's local KV / config
# store lives under one of these directories:
#   - Cloudflare local KV  -> .wrangler/state/v3/kv/*/db.sqlite
#   - Spin local KV        -> .spin/sqlite_key_value.db
#   - Axum local config    -> .edgezero/local-config-<id>.json
# All three are populated by `config push --local` (or by the
# runtime itself on first read) and should not be committed.
.wrangler/
.spin/
.edgezero/

# Fastly local config-push lock and staging temp files (sidecars next to the
# manifest; the lock serialises concurrent `config push --local` / `provision`,
# the temp is the atomic-replace staging file). `TempFileGuard` removes the temp
# on every normal return, but a SIGKILL / panic-abort mid-push can leave one
# behind. The globs also cover a manifest named something other than `fastly.toml`.
.*.edgezero-lock
.*.edgezero-*.tmp

